---
const portrait =
  "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/9bda209c-2f9a-472a-8fa4-5991feab83d8/78d9c.png";
---

<section id="about" class="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <h2 id="about-title">About Me</h2><p>
      User Interface and User Experience and Also video editing
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <div class="about-photo">
      <div></div><img src={portrait} alt="Amit Mehta in a black suit" />
    </div><div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        I am Amit Mehta, a B.Tech graduate with a strong interest in web
        development and building practical software applications. During my
        academic journey, I developed an interest in understanding how
        technology works beyond theoretical concepts and began exploring
        different areas of software development. I completed an internship at
        Netcamp, where I gained practical exposure to Android development and
        computer networking. After completing my B.Tech, I joined Ducat
        Institute to pursue a Full Stack with Python course, where I developed
        my skills in frontend and backend technologies. I enjoy learning by
        building projects and using practical implementation to strengthen my
        understanding of technology.
      </p><a
        class="download"
        href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}resume.pdf`}
        download="Amit-Mehta-Resume.pdf">Download CV</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .about {
    padding: 5px clamp(24px, 5.55vw, 80px) 120px;
  }
  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #fefefe;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 40px);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .section-intro p {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: #707070;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 20px);
  }
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(30px, 7vw, 100px);
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 65px auto 0;
  }
  .about-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 566px);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.1;
    justify-self: center;
  }
  .about-photo div {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 20% 0 0 4%;
    border-radius: 42% 42% 12px 12px;
    background: #191919;
  }
  .about-photo img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    mix-blend-mode: luminosity;
  }
  .about-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    color: #959595;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.9;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .download {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 12px 30px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fa6e00 0%, #e60026 100%);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about {
      padding-bottom: 80px;
    }
    .about-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .about-copy p {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
